<title>LATVIA: KAIJA SLIPS AT BOURSE PRICE FIX.</title>
<headline>KAIJA SLIPS AT BOURSE PRICE FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fish cannery Kaija slipped at the</p>
<p>reopening session of the bourse on Monday, hitting 2.02 lats</p>
<p>versus 2.15 lats.</p>
<p>Other shares were mixed to slightly lower.</p>
